Follow `AGENTS.md` §1 Workspace Entry Protocol; handoff per §3 before yielding.

`.agentvault/` (task board, handoffs, invariants, ADRs) owns task routing and
continuity. MemoryBank + `bin/avcoord` own TTL leases, the journal, and the
deterministic gate. Never create `.agentvault/MemoryBank/` (the health check
rejects the nesting as DUAL_SSOT), `workspace/SESSION_STATE.json`, or
`MemoryBank/active/`.
